alculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, August to September and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 51% of normal in August to September and 35% in November to December. Grid 22410 had its driest year in 2007 at 68% of normal.</p>"}
